  "description": "Explore the Features and Benefits of Myst Pro\nBuilt for the privateer racer, the Myst Pro is made to be hauled across the country and smashed down the nastiest downhill tracks.\nFeaturing the same Factory Team developed frame as the top model, the Pro is equally at home strapped to the back of an uplift trailer, or enjoying the once-a-year luxury of a chairlift in the Alps.\nOur Tuned Ride link allows the suspension to be more active under braking, giving more traction when you need it most.\nPlease note - the Saracen Myst does not come supplied with pedals. Add some from our gear store!\n\nFrame\nSeries 3 custom butted and hydroformed 6066 alloy aluminium\nFrame Travel\n211mm\nFork Travel\n200mm\nWheel Size\nMullet: 29\" front / 27.5\" rear\nFork\nRockShox Boxxer Select RC\nShock\nMarzocchi Bomber CR\nDrivetrain\n1 x 7 SRAM GX DH",
